        <activityName xml:lang="en">Precast concrete, high performance concrete, only common base, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Precast concrete, high performance concrete, only common base, at plant
Dataset describes the production of high performance concrete elements from self compacting concrete including all elements with a structural robustness of at least C70. Excludes the transportation to the construction site.;
UUID: 0ed079c5-8385-3d8b-a51b-23df61e6245a
Includes infrastructure, energy demand,treatment of wastes but does not include the ingrediants/ the composition of the precast concrete.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Formation with steel casing
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0ed079c5-8385-3d8b-a51b-23df61e6245a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
